      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUXTON NZ (6) continued his good form when he drew the outside barrier and raced parked but stuck on for third last week. Came from wider than this when he scored at this circuit and distance prior. Has only once missed a place in seven starts for Jason Grimson and should get his chance from a lower draw. BUZZ BOMB (3) is another that has been very consistent of late and was good when beaten only 2.6m in a higher-graded race last week. Overcame a wide draw to score by 7m in this company here prior. Big chance from a much more favourable barrier. Former Queenslander BIRKIRKARA (11) is a query in his first outing for the Grimson yard. He cops the outside barrier but he showed plenty of ability earlier in his career. BETTORLIGHTEM UP (4) gets his lowest draw for some time so could be an improver.",
